  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When using a custom \"gesture\" playable layer:\nBlendshapes which are potentially animated by an animation will have their resting value (the value in skinned mesh renderer component) doubled.\nThis happens since build 1107. \nThis doesn't happen when the blendshape isn't animated at all.\nIt seems to be related to the \"write defaults\" setting being ticked in the animator's state of the gesture controller.\nThis only happens when the blendshape is potentially animated, and their animation isn't playing yet.",
